  "title": "Listen: Colpey Calling x The Fix goes Latin American with Bristol’s Admin",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><em>30th October 2015</em> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-10185\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/colpey-admin.jpg\" alt=\"colpey-admin\" width=\"950\" height=\"400\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/colpey-admin.jpg 950w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/colpey-admin-300x126.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">This week Colpey Calling x The Fix went all Latin American, bringing together jazz and funk tracks by everyone from Tito Puente to Havana Cultura. We also welcomed Bristol&#8217;s Admin, who provided us with a mix of some of his Latin American influences.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">We were dead chuffed to get Admin on the show &#8211; he&#8217;s made some belting tracks in the last couple of years. His latest offering, the EP &#8216;<a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/boogie-cafe-records/admin-flute-loops-pre-master\" target=\"_blank\">Flute Loops</a>&#8216;, is out now on Bristol-based Boogie Cafe Records with a limited pressing, and recent release &#8216;<a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/the-ransom-note/premiere-admin-sancho-panza-banoffee-pies\" target=\"_blank\">Sancho Panza</a>&#8216; on Banoffee Pies Records was a particular favourite of ours. Look out for upcoming EP &#8216;Super Lover&#8217; on limited vinyl for Amsterdam-based Sleazy Beats Recordings!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/widget/iframe/?embed_type=widget_standard&amp;embed_uuid=f1052dc7-7f13-4801-a598-cb2cace60022&amp;feed=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mixcloud.com%2FTheFixMagazine%2Fcolpey-calling-x-the-fix-admin%2F&amp;hide_cover=1&amp;hide_tracklist=1&amp;replace=0\" width=\"660\" height=\"180\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe></p>\n<div style=\"clear: both; height: 3px; width: 652px;\"> </div>\n<p style=\"display: block; font-size: 11px; font-family: 'Open Sans', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 3px 4px; color: #999999; width: 652px;\"><a style=\"color: #808080; font-weight: bold;\" href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/TheFixMagazine/colpey-calling-x-the-fix-admin/?utm_source=widget&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;utm_campaign=base_links&amp;utm_term=resource_link\" target=\"_blank\">Colpey Calling x The Fix: Admin</a> by <a style=\"color: #808080; font-weight: bold;\" href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/TheFixMagazine/?utm_source=widget&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;utm_campaign=base_links&amp;utm_term=profile_link\" target=\"_blank\">The Fix Magazine</a> on <a style=\"color: #808080; font-weight: bold;\" href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/?utm_source=widget&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;utm_campaign=base_links&amp;utm_term=homepage_link\" target=\"_blank\"> Mixcloud</a></p>\n<div style=\"clear: both; height: 3px; width: 652px;\"> </div>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>",
